sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Caller Thread
    participant GW as GraphWorker
    participant BG as Background Thread (execute_parallel)

    Caller->>GW: request(graph, node_ids)
    Note over GW: Lock state_mutex, coalesce job,<br/>set cancelled = true if same graph
    GW->>Caller: post(start_next) via post_to_caller
    Caller->>GW: start_next()
    GW->>GW: on_pre_async_compute() on planned nodes
    GW->>BG: spawn std::thread -> execute_parallel(planned)
    BG-->>Caller: post(end_pass + start_next)
    Caller->>GW: end_pass()
    GW->>BG: thread.join()
    alt Error occurred
        GW->>Caller: failed(error) & drop failing graph jobs
    else Unstarted nodes left (cancelled/preempted)
        GW->>GW: on_async_compute_cancelled() & re-queue
    else All nodes completed
        GW->>Caller: graph->update_finished()
    end
